{"id":"genosse","lemma":"Genosse","pos":"noun","rank":2710,"glosses":["partner in something, mate","comrade, fellow socialist or communist","a member of the SPD, the German social democratic party"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈnɔsə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d6/De-Genosse.ogg/De-Genosse.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Genossen","plural":"Genossen","feminine":"Genossin"},"formAudio":{"Genossen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-genossen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir haben es alle genossen.","en":"We all enjoyed it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390496","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe es genossen.","en":"I've enjoyed it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390504","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},null]},{"text":"Wir genossen jede Minute der Party.","en":"We enjoyed every minute of the party.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"each","l":"jeder"},{"g":"minute (unit of time"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"party"}]},{"text":"Wir genossen das Schwimmen im See.","en":"We enjoyed swimming in the lake.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to swim"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"sea, ocean"}]},{"text":"Habt ihr euren Urlaub genossen?","en":"Did you enjoy your holiday?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"your","l":"euer"},{"g":"holiday, vacation"},null]}]}